*** Keywords ***
CB008990_DFE-Beamer_AAFIA_link_fault
    [Documentation]
    ...  Purpose of this test case is to check if system correctly raises fault in WebEM accordingly to raised internal alarms
    ...  according to DFE-Beamer link failures in MiRa family.
    ...  The test is intended for the following RMODs: AAFIA
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int first_AAFIA_rmod_id: (Mandatory) : RMOD runtime id of first tested AAFIA radio module, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param int second_AAFIA_rmod_id: (Mandatory) : RMOD runtime id of second tested AAFIA radio module, e.g.: 2
    ...  :param list link_id: (Mandatory) : list with numbers of port between nahka and beamer (chose one of – 6, 7, 8 and 9),
    ...                                     e.g.: [6] for single port or [6, 7, 8, 9] for all ports,
    ...  :param dict throughputs: (Mandatory) : dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                         it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                                         defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                                         Example:
    ...                                            {
    ...                                              '827736065':
    ...                                                    {
    ...                                                       'throughput':
    ...                                                           {
    ...                                                               'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                               'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                           },
    ...                                                       'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                                   },
    ...                                          }
    ...  :param str protocol: (Optional) : data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...  :param str udp_buffer: (Optional) : monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...  :param int tput_duration (Optional) : duration of data transfer in seconds; defaults to 30
    ...  :param bool tput_verification_via_btslog: (Optional) : True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                                         False - throuput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False
    ...  :param dict ue_network_modes: (Optional) : dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"}
    ...                                             possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                                             when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                             with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...                                             mandatory for SA+NSA setups, defaults to None8", "ssb_32",
    ...                                             default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.

    [Arguments]    ${first_AAFIA_rmod_id}
    ...            ${second_AAFIA_rmod_id}
    ...            ${link_id}
    ...            ${throughputs}
    ...            ${protocol}=udp
    ...            ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...            ${tput_duration}=30
    ...            ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${False}
    ...            ${ue_network_modes}=${None}

    [Timeout]      24 hours

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    FOR   ${AAFIA_rmod_id}   IN    ${first_AAFIA_rmod_id}  ${second_AAFIA_rmod_id}
       Execute L3 call
       ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
       ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
       ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
       ...                                                     duration=${tput_duration}s
       ...                                                     tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
       ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
       ${is_rmod_shared}                                       admin_info_model.is_rmod_shared
       ...                                                     rmod_id=${AAFIA_rmod_id}
       ...                                                     connection=${connection}
       Run keyword if                                          ${is_rmod_shared}
       ...                                                     Allow eNB alarms when concurrent mode
       Disable AAFIA Link Check Alarms And Wait For RMOD Recovery Action
       ...                                                     rmod_id=${AAFIA_rmod_id}
       ...                                                     link_id=${link_id}
       ...                                                     connection=${connection}
       ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
       Run keyword if                                          ${is_rmod_shared}
       ...                                                     Run keywords
       ...                                                     Sleep
       ...                                                     2 min
       ...                                                     Reason=Waiting for all alarms to be cleared on eNB.
       ...                                                     AND
       ...                                                     Disallow eNB alarms when concurrent mode
       Execute L3 call
       ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
       ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
       ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
       ...                                                     duration=${tput_duration}s
       ...                                                     tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
       ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    END

Disable AAFIA Link Check Alarms And Wait For RMOD Recovery Action
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${link_id}
    ...            ${connection}
    ...            ${bts_type}

    Create Action CPRIPortControl AAFIA                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Perform Action Disable Link AAFIA                       rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     link_id=${link_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Wait for recovery alarm with RMOD recovery reset and startup
    ...                                                     recovery_fault_id=1904
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

Create Action CPRIPortControl AAFIA
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${connection}

    Robot Log Step                                          Creating of action CPRIPortControl via FRMON on RMOD-${rmod_id}.
    ${activation_result}                                    rmod_ops.execute_frmon_command
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     command=/ action create CPRIPortControl /CPRIPortControl
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    Should Contain Any                                      ${activation_result}
    ...                                                     done ok    Path already taken
    ...                                                     msg=Activation is not completed.
    Robot Log Result                                        Activation is completed.

Perform Action Disable Link AAFIA
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${link_id}
    ...            ${connection}

    Robot Log Step                                          Activation of Disable link-${link_id} via FRMON on RMOD-${rmod_id}.
    ${action_result}                                        rmod_ops.execute_frmon_command
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     command=/CPRIPortControl action disable ${link_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Should Contain                                          ${action_result}
    ...                                                     done ok
    ...                                                     msg=Action performing is not completed.
    Robot Log Result                                        Action performing is completed.

